        "Web source 2"
      ],
      "source": "https://www.pa.gov/agencies/dcnr/programs-and-services/community-outreach-and-development/conservation-landscapes/south-mountain",
      "category": "nature",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "The region hosts Gettysburg National Military Park, the 85,000‑acre Michaux State Forest, and the 20,000‑acre South Mountain Fruit Belt.",
